# ---------------------------------------------------------------- generated
#
# `public/img`, `public/docs`, `public/catalogue` and `public/qr` are produced
# from `kaoming-website-kit-FINAL/` by the scripts in DEPLOYMENT.md, and were
# ignored here on the reasoning that anything reproducible does not belong in
# history.
#
# They are committed now, and the reason is worth writing down: a build host has
# no kit. Ignoring them meant any deployment — Vercel, a colleague's clone,
# anything that is not this laptop — built and served successfully while
# rendering a site with no machines on it, an empty catalogue, and a 404 behind
# every download. Reproducible is not the same as present.
#
# 117 MB, of which 99 MB is the three catalogue PDFs. That is the cost of the
# site being complete anywhere it is checked out.

# ------------------------------------------------------------- source archive
#
# The kit is 135 MB of catalogue PDFs, print-resolution renders and blueprints —
# the authority for every specification on the site (CLAUDE.md), but input
# material rather than source code, and too heavy for git.
#
# The transcribed data the site actually renders IS committed, under
# `kaoming-web/content/`. The kit stays on disk and belongs in asset storage,
# not here.
kaoming-website-kit-FINAL/
kaoming-website-kit-FINAL.zip

